flowchart TB
    X[Input / phenomenon / question] --> O[Canonical object + immutable ID]
    O --> R[Typed relation graph]
    R --> G[Registered geometry]
    G --> T[Deterministic transformation]
    T --> V[Invariant and schema validation]
    V --> P[Proof / provenance record]
    P --> E[Explanation / visualization / action]
    E --> F[Ground truth and feedback]
    F --> X

    subgraph Geometry[Geometry vocabulary]
      E8[E8: discrete roots and Weyl reflections]
      H[Hopf: S3 to S2 fibered projection]
      FS[Fubini-Study: projective distance]
      M[Mobius: compact state update]
      AP[Amplitude-phase encoding]
    end
    G --> E8
    G --> H
    G --> FS
    G --> M
    G --> AP

    subgraph Runtime[Runtime surfaces]
      L[Logos: language and inference]
      N[Monad: state transition]
      C[Colony: routing and consensus]
      U[UI / API / MCP / games / hardware]
    end
    T --> L
    T --> N
    P --> C
    E --> U
